<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10716] Rest clients should call ctx.security().onSessionExpired(subjid) on disconnect to avoid the possible leaking of the memory</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10716</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;At the moment ctx.security().onSessionExpired(subjid) didn&apos;t called on rest session expiration.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It provides the leaking of the memory related to resources that were generated during authentification.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
