&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10716&quot; title=&quot;Rest clients should call ctx.security().onSessionExpired(subjid) on disconnect to avoid the possible leaking of the memory&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-10716&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-10716&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: ctx.security().onSessionExpired(subjid) is called on rest session expiration now.&lt;/p&gt;

